            "review_title": "Review at Metta Vegetarian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "swaminathan i\nMarion, Iowa87 contributions\n0\nBaby Jackfruits make for a healthy salad\nDec 2024 • Friends\nThe baby jackfruit (JF) was a big surprise. It is largely seen in Hoi An and Hue cuisine. Rare to find this type of salad in Sai Gon as Westerners think Pho and Banh mi define Vietnamese cuisine. Buddhist vegetarian cuisine is growing in Vietnam per my Vietnamese friends. Our three dishes were a filling meal for us. Service was prompt. For me it was a beautiful night exposed to the cosmic forces yonder.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTaxis are inexpensive in saigon.Maybe under usd5-6 for a round trip fm d Riverside Saigon area. We dd nt order any oily dishes. I dd nt pay\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 7, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
